  m_functionName: 
  m_description: "Performs a stylized light calculation based on a toon control vector
    and the raw N\xB7L term.\nComputes a light response, a toon-based light modulation
    influenced by world position and shadow attenuation, applies a minimum-based
    clamp between both terms, and outputs the original main light color."
